{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "gugfdw679w2uvg7g", "title": "44.LangChain整合维基百科实现网页问答", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ub02f7b54\" id=\"ub02f7b54\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4500da3\" id=\"uf4500da3\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0b0c1578\" id=\"u0b0c1578\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fppt%2F1387387%2F1745159944968-c1536759-3b1f-4a16-b600-160f36b182dc.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22langchain-web.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A8588%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22udd935f05-bc74-4e27-86e7-eab4e26722c%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8fc65d1b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2a34d5f0\" id=\"u2a34d5f0\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9eed3d13\" id=\"u9eed3d13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9d0f9788\" id=\"u9d0f9788\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b6ccf17\" id=\"u5b6ccf17\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">python版本：3.12.4</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"DDJIb\" id=\"DDJIb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2151abe6\" id=\"u2151abe6\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">导入依赖库</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u1f5abbaa\" id=\"u1f5abbaa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19d530d8\" id=\"u19d530d8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">我们将首先导入聊天机器人所需的库。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9Aweb_search.py%5Cnimport%20time%5Cnfrom%20datetime%20import%20datetime%5Cn%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cnimport%20streamlit%20as%20st%5Cnimport%20wikipedia%5Cnfrom%20bs4%20import%20BeautifulSoup%5Cnfrom%20langchain.schema%20import%20AIMessage%2C%20HumanMessage%2C%20SystemMessage%5Cnfrom%20langchain.text_splitter%20import%20CharacterTextSplitter%5Cnfrom%20langchain_community.vectorstores%20import%20FAISS%5Cnfrom%20langchain_openai%20import%20ChatOpenAI%5Cnfrom%20langchain_openai%20import%20OpenAIEmbeddings%5Cnfrom%20streamlit_chat%20import%20message%5Cnglobal%20docsearch%5Cnfrom%20langchain.globals%20import%20set_verbose%5Cndocsearch%20%3D%20None%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V8LzU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"qUk14\" id=\"qUk14\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4e94030\" id=\"uf4e94030\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">爬取维基百科</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uecbd91b6\" id=\"uecbd91b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc9296139\" id=\"uc9296139\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">构建聊天机器人的第一步是访问维基百科文章并提取内容。该</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufe01386c\" id=\"ufe01386c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a27a11c\" id=\"u5a27a11c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">get_wiki</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u55a983b0\" id=\"u55a983b0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">函数接受搜索词并返回整页内容和维基百科文章的摘要。该</span><code data-lake-id=\"u01a8ae3f\" id=\"u01a8ae3f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c3b3efa\" id=\"u1c3b3efa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">wikipedia.summary</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua208714d\" id=\"ua208714d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">方法搜索摘要，以及</span><code data-lake-id=\"u1fabf2c2\" id=\"u1fabf2c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2f730cb7\" id=\"u2f730cb7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">requests</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1a5597db\" id=\"u1a5597db\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">用于访问文章的 URL 的模块。该</span><code data-lake-id=\"u597273b8\" id=\"u597273b8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub40fdd77\" id=\"ub40fdd77\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">BeautifulSoup</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub5f74a58\" id=\"ub5f74a58\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">模块使用在解析页面的HTML内容，该</span><code data-lake-id=\"u6c13c038\" id=\"u6c13c038\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub036b888\" id=\"ub036b888\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">content_div.find_all('p')</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u811852f5\" id=\"u811852f5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">行从页面上的段落中提取文本。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20get_wiki(search)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%B0%86%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%BA%E7%AE%80%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87%EF%BC%88%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%EF%BC%89%5Cn%20%20%20%20lang%20%3D%20%5C%22zh%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E4%BB%8E%E7%BB%B4%E5%9F%BA%E7%99%BE%E7%A7%91%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20set%20language%20to%20zh_CN%20(default%20is%20auto-detect)%5Cn%20%20%20%20wikipedia.set_lang(lang)%5Cn%20%20%20%20summary%20%3D%20wikipedia.summary(search%2C%20sentences%3D5)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E6%8A%93%E5%8F%96%E6%89%80%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%B4%E5%9F%BA%E7%99%BE%E7%A7%91%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%92%8C%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BAURL%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20f%5C%22https%3A%2F%2F%7Blang%7D.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2F%7Bsearch%7D%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%90%91URL%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81GET%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%B9%B6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90HTML%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%5Cn%20%20%20%20response%20%3D%20requests.get(url)%5Cn%20%20%20%20soup%20%3D%20BeautifulSoup(response.content%2C%20%5C%22html.parser%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%8F%90%E5%8F%96%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%5Cn%20%20%20%20content_div%20%3D%20soup.find(id%3D%5C%22mw-content-text%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%91%98%E5%BD%95%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E6%AE%B5%E8%90%BD%5Cn%20%20%20%20paras%20%3D%20content_div.find_all('p')%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%B0%86%E6%AE%B5%E8%90%BD%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E6%88%90%E6%95%B4%E9%A1%B5%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%5Cn%20%20%20%20full_page_content%20%3D%20%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20para%20in%20paras%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20full_page_content%20%2B%3D%20para.text%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E6%95%B4%E9%A1%B5%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20full_page_content%2C%20summary%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o2Afc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"Zo8CU\" id=\"Zo8CU\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4cdce461\" id=\"u4cdce461\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">设置用户界面</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3791132f\" id=\"u3791132f\" style=\"color: inherit\"> </span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u4a4d5108\" id=\"u4a4d5108\"><span data-lake-id=\"u138e1119\" id=\"u138e1119\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">接下来，我们使用 Streamlit 设置用户界面。我们首先创建一个标题：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22st.markdown(%5C%22%3Ch1%20style%3D'text-align%3A%20center%3B%20color%3A%20Black%3B'%3E%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%20Web%20URL%20%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E7%AD%94%3C%2Fh1%3E%5C%22%2C%20unsafe_allow_html%3DTrue)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nhygq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u79a82d50\" id=\"u79a82d50\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf680954\" id=\"ubf680954\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">这将为聊天机器人创建一个大而居中的标题。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u37b49762\" id=\"u37b49762\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub380b699\" id=\"ub380b699\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">环境变量配置好</span><span data-lake-id=\"u0de5290b\" id=\"u0de5290b\" style=\"color: #080808; background-color: #ffffff\">OPENAI_BASE_URL和OPENAI_API_KEY</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22setx%20OPENAI_BASE_URL%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fapi.openai.com%2Fv1%5C%22%5Cnsetx%20OPENAI_API_KEY%20%5C%22sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nf0Ue%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u5855fe4f\" id=\"u5855fe4f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2013ffed\" id=\"u2013ffed\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">一旦用户输入他们的 OpenAI 密钥，我们就会初始化 GPT 模型并要求他们输入搜索查询，该查询将用于抓取相关的 Wikipedia 页面。get_wiki()函数将返回搜索查询和抓取页面的摘要。现在，如果它返回了一些值，则 Q&amp;A 字段将被激活，用户可以提问。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22search%20%3D%20st.text_input(%5C%22%E8%AF%B7%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E8%A6%81%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E8%AF%8D%5C%22)%5Cnif%20len(search)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20wiki_content%2C%20summary%20%3D%20get_wiki(search)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20len(wiki_content)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20try%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%86%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20st.write(summary)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20user_query%20%3D%20st.text_input(%5C%22You%3A%20%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20key%3D%5C%22input%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20send_button%20%3D%20st.button(%5C%22Send%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YsP4O%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uafcbd71d\" id=\"uafcbd71d\"><span data-lake